            "review_title": "Review at Pasta De Pasta",
            "review_text": "Excursion19161794106\n17 contributions\n0\nPasta - an excellent change!\nAug 2024 • Solo\nVery delicious and fresh pasta! You choose the amount of fat ucine and a sauce. After cooking, the pasta is placed in a large Parmesan to absorb its seasoning and creaminess, then the sauce is added. The pesto and pasta were excellent and also the tiramisu excellent!!\nI was pulled into the restaurant by the cosy ambience as I passed. Since I have been on Trips for some time and mostly eat regionally, Italian cuisine was a welcome change 🙂\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nTranslated from German\nShow original\nWritten August 11, 2024",
