            "review_title": "Review at Pasta De Pasta",
            "review_text": "Aliona K\nLimassol City, Cyprus5 contributions\n0\nDELICIOUS\nMay 2024 • Friends\nI’m on vacation in Vietnam for the fifth time and all the time I thought that you could only eat delicious seafood in Vietnamese cafes... But I was very pleasantly surprised that Italian pasta can be served with such delicious shrimp and mussels! I found this place right in the city center and had lunch there every day. It’s very good that the establishment is only 10 minutes from the beach and you can easily return to your sun lounger after lunch. The interior is reminiscent of little Italy, and you can take tiramisu and sangria with you if the pasta turns out to be too filling... I recommend you visit this place\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten May 22, 2024",
