            "review_text": "lera\n2 contributions\n0\nWe recommend! Pasta is delicious 🤤\nMay 2024 • Family\nExcellent Italian pasta in the center of Nha Trang.\n\nWe ran into this place with our whole hungry family. We have three children and everyone was just sooooo happy. We ordered pasta with seafood, namely shrimp and mussels, asked for a non-spicy sauce and everything was served to us as we wanted. What I want to note: very quickly, and this is so important when three children under 5 years old are running around, making noise and demanding impressions😂 The owner seems to be Italian, very nice and kind. We also liked tiramisu, but we took it with us because the pasta is very filling. In general, the establishment is very suitable for those who want to eat quickly and tasty. Our whole family recommends it.\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten May 20, 2024",
